#: ../../../source/model_zoo/index.md:49
msgid ""
"Every model shares one PyBaMM floor: the zoo's own `pybamm` requirement, "
"which `pip` enforces when it installs the zoo. The `model_zoo_status` "
"workflow refreshes the table below weekly, running every model against "
"`main`, the oldest PyBaMM release the zoo supports, and the most recent "
"releases (`scripts/matrix.py --releases` sets how many). A cell reading "
"`missing` is one whose job never reported, not a pass."
msgstr ""

